  "details": "Vrchats VCC is creating projects with version 3.7.6 instead of the latest SDK version , meaning that everytime a project gets created you will have to manually head into it again and change the SDK version to the newest one \n\nThe reason this seems to be happening is that the VCC when creating a project is set to use the latest 3.7.* version which isnt accurate / up to date anymore due to SDK now beeing on the 3.8.* release cycle \n\nManually changing this fixed the creation issue but it shouldnt be required\n\n(I have seen other posts abt this marked as \"complete\" but its not complete and not working and hasnt been working for AGES please fix this issue [Yes even new VCC installations come with this bug])\n\nPosts should not be marked as completed if they arent completed , while the fix has not been shipped to users its NOT completed and should not be marked as such",
